BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Elizabethtown Democrats Greet Voters at the Polls
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T040000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T060000
UID:39e70b86496dd9972fc8e0252eb78b8e@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Blue%20Crew_20260830033612948093.png
DESCRIPTION:Join the Etown Blue Crew! Help us greet voters\, ensure electi
 on integrity\, get out the vote\, and share important candidate informatio
 n at the polls on Election Day! Sign up for as many 2-hour shifts as you'd
  like! As a member of the Blue Crew\, you can help out in any of the follo
 wing ways: 🔵 Greet voters at the polls 🔵 Call or text voters to remi
 nd them to vote 🔵 Give rides to the polls 🔵 Deliver snacks and suppl
 ies to polling locations 🔵 Help ensure election integrity
LOCATION:Elizabethtown\, Elizabethtown\, PA\, 17022
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/1021448/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
