DESCRIPTION:The Lancaster Township Democratic Committee meets monthly to d
 iscuss upcoming elections\, meet local candidates for office\, plan volunt
 eer actions and get-out-the-vote events\, and more. Come a little early to
  meet friends and catch up. All local Democrats are welcome to attend!
LOCATION:Lancaster Friends School @ HPUCC\, 1210 Maple Ave\, Lancaster\, P
 A\, 17603
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/1015575/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
