BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Knock for Nancy Mannion and the Democratic Party Slate -- Lancaste
 r
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T090000
UID:b5d8fea13ffdb293e4895e799629b672@mobilize.us
DESCRIPTION:**Sign up for a shift\, or reach out to request a custom list 
 for yourself to walk on your own time!** Join us as we knock on doors and 
 talk to neighbors to elect Dr. Nancy Mannion RN to the US House of Represe
 ntatives! Nancy is seeking to represent all of us in the 11th district--La
 ncaster County and Southern York County. We will also share information ab
 out the Governor and Lt. Governor with voters. Whether you are an experien
 ced field operative or new to door-to-door canvassing\, we need you! W
LOCATION:Proffitt Porch\, 1028 Woods Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/citizensfornancymannion/event/1000125/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
